# Private keys and certificates
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.der
**/*.priv
**/*.pub
**/*id_rsa*
**/*id_dsa*
**/*id_ecdsa*
**/*id_ed25519*

